{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28917","headline":"与裴三十秀才自越西归望亭阻冻登虎丘山寺精舍 · 许浑","name":"与裴三十秀才自越西归望亭阻冻登虎丘山寺精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春草越吴间，心期旦夕还。\n酒乡逢客病，诗境遇僧闲。\n倚棹冰生浦，登楼雪满山。\n东风不可待，归鬓坐斑斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}